cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Danio pegRNA Designer
message: >-
  If you use this tool, please cite the publications the design rules are
  taken from, listed under references below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Varshney
    given-names: Gaurav K.
    affiliation: Oklahoma Medical Research Foundation, Oklahoma City, OK, USA
repository-code: "https://github.com/thevarshneylab/thevarshneylab.github.io/tree/main/pegrna-designer"
url: "https://thevarshneylab.github.io/pegrna-designer/"
abstract: >-
  A browser-based prime editing guide RNA designer for zebrafish. Sweeps
  primer binding site and reverse transcription template lengths, selects the
  PBS whose hybrid with the nicked target melts near the incubation
  temperature, reports the auto-inhibitory PBS-spacer duplex, finds PE3 and
  PE3b nicking guides, and resolves GRCz11 coordinates through Ensembl.
keywords:
  - CRISPR
  - prime editing
  - zebrafish
  - pegRNA design
  - GRCz11
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-19"
